    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d31-a8">

                <pb facs="0712" n="702" xml:id="pg702"/>

                <head>Appendix 317</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Board of Trade, Communications Section</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#small-caps">British</hi>), <lb/>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Supreme Economic Council</hi>, <lb/> 23 <hi
                            rendition="#small-caps">Buckingham Gate, <placeName>London</placeName>,
                            S. W.</hi> 1[, <date
                            ana="#date_undated-inferred-from-document-content-and-sibling-dates"
                            calendar="gregorian" notAfter="1920-01-30T23:59:59+00:00"
                            notBefore="1920-01-16T00:00:00+01:00"
                    >undated</date>].</dateline></opener>
                <p rendition="#flush"><hi rendition="#small-caps">British Secretary, Supreme
                        Economic Council</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Trafalgar House, Waterloo
                        Place, S. W. 1</hi>.</p>
                <p>I enclose herewith for your information copy of some clear and concise reports on
                    the situation in Vienna which may be of interest to you.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">G. Maxwell</hi></signed>, <hi
                        rendition="#italic">Colonel</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">For Chairman,
                        Communications Section</hi>.</closer>
            </div>
        </body>
